# Forked from Alpine's main/mesa (aports master, 26.2.6-r0) by way of the
# amazon-suez temp/mesa aport, for amazon-sheldonp GPU bring-up: plain Mesa
# main, NO local patches, to test the PowerVR GE8300 (22.68.54.30) with
# the latest pvr driver. Trimmed: gallium zink and llvmpipe, Vulkan
# imagination and lavapipe. Do not merge this into pmaports master.
maintainer="Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>"
